<title>CHINA: General Accident opens Shanghai office.</title>
<headline>General Accident opens Shanghai office.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British insurance company General Accident opened its second Chinese representative office in Shanghai on Wednesday, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The General Accident set up its first office in March 1994 in Beijing and spent $1.0 million last year to sponsor an insurance training centre at the South Western University of Finance and Economics in Chengdu, Sichuan province.</p>
